{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56879","headline":"华亭君歌 · 佚名","name":"华亭君歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华亭君，来几时，免我疾苦疗我饥。\n（《檇李诗系》卷四二）（〖1〗《檇李诗系》：「唐末，琅琊张聿爲嘉兴军华亭令。\n有以干乞至境上者，闻民此歌，不谒而去。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}